c6343795c8c7e4feff55f5b309365c8e0eaf49cd6abcb412e32315313f149536) with the
driver's hunks of linux-hwe-7.0_7.0.0-34.34~24.04.1.diff.gz (sha256
81b9d83f6863ea9d41bde191923134fe6bf4261bfcf94a376b85c094fafd6c32) applied:
the uninterruptible resv lock for plane flushes, the atomic-only shutdown,
