through kernel-6.12.0-275.el10 (commit
e2cfc9d2e9cb4c143b510e91efad5fa9448dba8a) is byte-identical to the files
here, fetched file by file and compared 2026-10-13; kernel-6.12.0-261.el10
(commit 619fbe8f949d6a17649454b1a8a9b54cda1fb1a8) differs in virtgpu_drv.c,
virtgpu_drv.h, virtgpu_gem.c, virtgpu_plane.c, virtgpu_prime.c and
